# TypeScript

- Use **TypeScript** for all new application code under `src/` and for SvelteKit route/module files (e.g. `+server.ts`, `+layout.server.ts`, `hooks.server.ts`).
- Svelte components: `<script lang="ts">` (not plain `script`).
- Do **not** add new plain `.js` source files under `src/`. When changing existing `.js`, prefer renaming/migrating to `.ts` in the same edit when it is straightforward.
- Config and tooling in this repo already use TypeScript (e.g. `vite.config.ts`); keep new config as `.ts` unless the tool requires otherwise.
